or keeps the left series when they are present
[('pod','p1')]	1
[('pod','p2')]	2
or fills an empty left side with vector(0)
[]	0
or range fills only the steps where the left side is absent
[]	[('1970-01-01 00:01:50.000',0),('1970-01-01 00:02:00.000',0)]
[('pod','p1')]	[('1970-01-01 00:01:40.000',1)]
[('pod','p2')]	[('1970-01-01 00:01:40.000',2)]
and keeps the left series when the right side is present
[('pod','p1')]	1
[('pod','p2')]	2
and with an empty right side returns no series
0
unless drops the left series when the right side is present
0
unless keeps the left series when the right side is empty
[('pod','p1')]	1
[('pod','p2')]	2
or drops the right side when the left side is present
[]	1
on(pod) still removes every tag except pod
